        "id": "tf-explain",
        "description": "Explain the role of the step product in fixed-step descent.",
        "hostOwned": true
      }
    ],
    "content": [
      {
        "id": "note-derivation",
        "kind": "derivation",
        "text": "Each step subtracts η times the gradient a·x, so x is multiplied by 1 − η·a."
      },
      {
        "id": "note-assumption",
        "kind": "assumption",
